                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ccdc31d8-957a-3846-9b9d-e6288681a604",
                        "entry_id": "48865db2-c560-38bf-a0bf-b3a4059c6377",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Zustand der Rechtlosigkeit und Ausbeutung"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b73650a5-c12e-4d3c-8ffe-8b95fa5f0852",
                                "sense_id": "ccdc31d8-957a-3846-9b9d-e6288681a604",
                                "text": "Ihr Leben in Knechtschaft als rechtlose und abgabepflichtige Heloten, eine Art an das Land gebundene Staatssklaven, wurde besiegelt."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8b868094-9e11-4341-ae2b-a59b2b813bd5",
                                "sense_id": "ccdc31d8-957a-3846-9b9d-e6288681a604",
                                "text": "„Denn kaum irgendwo auf dem Kontinent ist zu dieser Zeit die Knechtschaft verboten.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "236707bc-3748-4d8c-bd18-4b23279d146f",
                                "sense_id": "ccdc31d8-957a-3846-9b9d-e6288681a604",
                                "text": "„Der Turban der Juden oder Christen ist dunkel und von grobwollenem Stoff zum Zeichen ihrer Knechtschaft; in Persien ist es diesen Parias überhaupt verboten, den Turban zu tragen.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eb8b27b3-8a5c-4ca3-a380-6bfc2fcb707c",
                        "source_entry_id": "48865db2-c560-38bf-a0bf-b3a4059c6377",
                        "source_sense_id": "ccdc31d8-957a-3846-9b9d-e6288681a604",
                        "source_sense_description": "Zustand der Rechtlosigkeit und Ausbeutung",
                        "target_lang_word": "servitude",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "servitude",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "db06d3f0-4128-386a-97fc-0649cd41b1be",
                                        "entry_id": "99a3e37f-7583-3b61-98eb-e3340ae46d12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being a slave; slavery; being forced to work for others or do their bidding without one's consent or against one's will, either in perpetuity or for a period of time over which one has little or no control."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0012bd5f-4795-417a-9891-ea91282f001e",
                                                "sense_id": "db06d3f0-4128-386a-97fc-0649cd41b1be",
                                                "text": "In spite of the importance of this route it remained until a few years ago very insecure. Overhung almost its entire length by the inaccessible fastnesses of Lololand, the passing caravans dared journey only with convoy, and even then were frequently overwhelmed by raiders from the hills, who carried off both trader and goods into the mountains, the former to lifelong servitude."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdbe9840-8e25-41e9-ad5b-da3f7b2af56f",
                                                "sense_id": "db06d3f0-4128-386a-97fc-0649cd41b1be",
                                                "text": "Balfour, who had sought refuge in Argentina, was extradited, and sentenced to a long term of penal servitude at Parkhurst Prison in the Isle of Wight."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f42a0bf-f984-4518-94b4-d8d91450a0db",
                                                "sense_id": "db06d3f0-4128-386a-97fc-0649cd41b1be",
                                                "text": "The Enlightment worldview, which considered the order of \"Nature\" as a basis and, at the same time, the subject of explorations of scientific natural sciences, has, at the same time, considered this order as a criterion of the artistically-aesthetic qualities of art. From an \"ideological\" point of view, it liberated art from its feudal religious and courtly servitude."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "50e6207f-9e4a-37f4-ad0b-e1e22da1b16f",
                                        "entry_id": "99a3e37f-7583-3b61-98eb-e3340ae46d12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A qualified beneficial interest severed or fragmented from the ownership of an inferior property and attached to a superior property or to some person other than the owner; the most common form is an easement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "492b3e9d-d4f5-3552-b7db-af92093c1077",
                                        "entry_id": "99a3e37f-7583-3b61-98eb-e3340ae46d12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Service rendered in the army or navy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "dated",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ee3c9c7e-c0d3-3dcc-8c8a-e783b9f82f6e",
                                        "entry_id": "99a3e37f-7583-3b61-98eb-e3340ae46d12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Servants collectively."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "obsolete",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff125acf-25f3-39d8-bd32-f6d37ba0f2d6",
                                        "entry_id": "99a3e37f-7583-3b61-98eb-e3340ae46d12",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The act of serving (food or drink, etc.); service."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14a024cb-df76-4925-be7d-3bdc0d8c0789",
                                                "sense_id": "ff125acf-25f3-39d8-bd32-f6d37ba0f2d6",
                                                "text": "The usual routine of confections and pastry follows, after which a galore of fruits of all kinds, with a chassè of excellent Mocha, the immediate servitude of which, after good dining, is, I think, universally acknowledged to be a great exhiliration^([sic])."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
